{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/239030-city-spirit-examples","id":239030,"title":"City Spirit examples?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-24T05:26:47-07:00","id":239030,"title":"City Spirit examples?","content":"I figured I'd put it here, since even though it's not a werewolf-specific question, Werewolf talks about city spirits the most.<br /> <br /> Basically, I'm just curious; are there any written out entries for an actual city-spirit in any of the books (Werewolf or otherwise)? As far as I can tell, most just get vague mentions; Lodge of London, for instance, talks about it from a roleplaying standpoint, and there's a sidebar saying most city spirits are greater jagglings, but that's it. Is there ANY entry with a fully statted example of a city spirit, anywhere?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-24T10:13:45-07:00","id":239302,"title":"","content":"One of the fastest examples that I could locate is for the Urban Avatar spirit from Territories. A full fledged city spirit depending on the city may be very similar to this spirit, or far stronger. For example, the spirit of a city in the middle of the midwest is probably a full rank (or even 2 ranks) lower than the spirit of a city such as New York or Las Vegas. It is not just the population that matters, but what it represents.<br /> <br /> The urban avatar is the spirit of the community given form, an amalgamation of the community's hopes and dreams and fears, coupled with all the little niceties and worries that go along with everyday life. The Urban Avatar is people and cars and buildings and pet goldfish and anything and everything in-between. The avatar of a place can be hidden or overt, but interacting with it is always difficult; it is, after all, the personification of an abstract concept, and mortals (even werewolves) have difficulty grasping such things.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Rank: 3</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Attributes: Power 7; Finesse 5; Resistance 9</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Willpower: 1 6</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Essence: 20 (max 20)</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Initiative: 1 4</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Defense: 7</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Speed: 2 2 (species factor 1 0)</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Size: 5</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Corpus: 1 4</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Numina:</b> Chorus, Communion with the Land, Discorpora</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1A1A18\"><span style=\"font-family:Skia\"><span style=\"font-size:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">tion, Materialize, Material Vision, Possession, Reaching, Technological Mastery, Wilds Sense<br /> * <b>Communion with the Land:</b> As the five-dot Knowledge Gift<br /> * <b>Technological Mastery:</b> Urban avatars can use all of the Gifts on the Technology Gift list.</span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":444,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","user":"Dessembrae","date":". 08-24-2014, 01:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","name":"Dessembrae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar444_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-24T12:20:22-07:00","id":239397,"title":"","content":"More of a town spirit, but there's one in Night Horrors: Wolfsbane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-24T15:09:42-07:00","id":239603,"title":"","content":"Alright, thanks to both of you, I'll take a look.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatar